Files that contain derived material:

  src/cti_report_lint/redact.py
      Code copied verbatim: the IPv4 octet expression and the two Bitcoin
      address alternatives in PATTERNS (the boundaries around them, the
      uppercase bech32 alternative and the checksum validation are this
      project's).
      Adapted: the numbered [KIND_N] placeholder scheme and the per-run map
      (from scripts/redact.py). An earlier version also copied the
      longest-first restore loop; it was replaced by a single-pass restore.

  src/cti_report_lint/findings.py
      Constants and formula adapted: the five finding types and their base
      weights, the 1-5 trust scale, the strength formula and its +1.5
      confirmation cap (from engine/finding-framework.md).

  src/cti_report_lint/conflicts.py
      Adapted: the conflict types, the four severity levels and the
      grade_severity rule (from engine/conflict-resolver.md).

  src/cti_report_lint/standards.py
      Adapted: the analytic-language rules, the evidence ceiling table and the
      5W1H "effort versus answer" overlay (from handbook/analytic-standards.md).
      The likelihood bands themselves are those of ICD 203.

